<p>division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 1 (Bogarde 84) Volendam 1 (Aandewiel 66).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 46,483.</p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 3 (Curovic 27, Van den Brom 40, 84) NAC Breda 0.</p>
